Fever. Say it with me. Fever!

12
00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:13.173
Cough. Say it with me. Cough!

13
00:01:16.677 --> 00:01:20.193
Pain. Say it with me. Pain!

14
00:01:23.694 --> 00:01:27.044
Tired. Say it with me. Tired!

15
00:01:30.527 --> 00:01:34.344
Strong. Say it with me. Strong!

16
