Better. Say it with me. Better!

17
00:01:44.843 --> 00:01:53.362
Grammar time! I feel, . Listen. I feel sick today. I feel healthy now.

18
00:01:53.412 --> 00:01:59.380
Your turn. Say it with me. I feel sick today. I feel healthy now.

19
00:02:04.597 --> 00:02:11.837
When I feel sick, my mother takes me to the doctor. I take medicine and rest. Exercise keeps me healthy.

20
00:02:11.887 --> 00:02:13.211
I like this story!

21
00:02:13.903 --> 00:02:19.303
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:19.353 --> 00:02:20.503
Doctor!

23
00:02:21.296 --> 00:02:26.586
Look! What's the word?

24
00:02:26.636 --> 00:02:27.786
Fever!

25
00:02:28.720 --> 00:02:36.461
Think and answer. What do you do to stay healthy?

26
00:02:36.511 --> 00:02:37.679
Great answer!

27
00:02:38.756 --> 00:02:41.278
This unit's value is Self-Care.

28
00:02:41.328 --> 00:02:43.077
I can show self-care every day!

29
00:02:43.757 --> 00:02:49.591
